Package: JamoviReport
Type: Package
Title: Educational Statistical Reporting for R and jamovi
Version: 0.1.0.9011
Authors@R: person("Christian", "Higton", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "christianhigton@gmail.com")
Description: Provides guided statistical analyses with assumption diagnostics,
    modern effect sizes, confidence intervals, educational interpretation, and
    selectable APA-style reporting. The package is designed for use directly
    from R and through a companion jamovi module interface.
